# Normalise line endings.
#
# This repository is edited on Windows and deployed on Linux. Without this,
# every file checked out on Windows comes back as modified (CRLF vs LF), the
# working tree is permanently dirty, and diffs between machines are unreadable.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores LF in the repository and checks out LF everywhere.
# Shell scripts and Docker files MUST be LF or they break inside the container.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary

